Purdue ໄດ້. ແລະແນະ ນໍາ ລາຍການງົບປະມານຂອງ... ລາວຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ.

590
00:50:50,650 --> 00:50:56,650
[GEORGE]
...oh, eighty grand. For a suitable `flying laboratory.' Her eyes just bug out.      No!   He nods, slowly.   Uh-huh.   And she... ...THROWS her arms around his neck, KISSING him hard enough
